  "details": "I cant play VRC for 15 days because everytime i connect it keeps saying that the connection has timed out and then the game tries to reload the map again, but the issue happens again.\nMost of the times it happens instantly, other times i only see a black screen and then it times out and sometimes i can get in for few minutes and then timeout again.\ni tried everything i could\nchanged DNS, internet, changed routers, did IPv6 config, disable IPv6, but the problem persists.\nalso every other game i have runs perfectly, only VRChat has this issue, so i think it is something on VRC servers.\nim having this problem since 15 days ago, after an update on friday i believe.\nPlz i really really wanna play this game again so i can hang out with my friends.\nSo plz i would be very grateful if u guys could solve this issue",
